{"id": "60405", "title": "门当户对", "author": "银色桃妖", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 10, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/60/60405.htm", "intro": "属性分类：古代／其他／一般言情／正剧\r\n关键字：付辛 宫小甲\r\n\r\n文案：\r\n嘛，什么NP——五花肉——重口味——乱X——口毕【这本书里都木有。\r\n某艾看得下去的文基本上就是剧情肉，偶尔整理些小福利也是萌萌的轻松小肉文——\r\nSo~~~不要担心虐心虐身，文荒的时候把本文当个欢乐的小调剂看就好，啊咧，肿么代写的文案变成了这乱七八糟的￣□￣｜｜", "base": "files/article/html/60/60405", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "8865942.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "8865943.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "8865944.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "8865945.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "8865946.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6", "file": "8865948.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7", "file": "8865952.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8", "file": "8865955.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9", "file": "8865957.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10", "file": "8865958.html", "available": false}]}